# DocuGrid agent defaults

- Repo product name: **DocuGrid** (`docs/product-naming.md`). Folder `TAXX` ≠ product name.
- Default stack: `frontend/` + `backend/main.py`. Skip `backend/core/` unless asked.
- Minimize exploration: read `AGENTS.md` map first; grep narrow paths; avoid Task/subagents unless user asks.

## Output

- Implement first; explain only non-obvious security or tenancy choices.
- End with: files changed, `pytest` command, remaining risk (if any).
- No markdown files unless user requests docs — **exception:** user-facing UI changes must update `docs/help/coverage.md` (+ stub/page). See `.cursor/rules/docugrid-help.mdc`.

## Code style

- Match surrounding code. Minimal diff. No drive-by refactors.
- New tenancy checks: reuse `authorize_client_access`, `authorize_firm_resource` from `backend/services/tenancy.py`.
- User-facing UI: update `docs/help/coverage.md` (+ help page stub). See `docugrid-help` rule.
